            "meaning": "Where accurate records are not maintained, an employer is required to clearly demonstrate that full-time teachers of elementary, secondary, or higher education institutions did not work 1,250 hours in the prior 12 months to support claiming they are ineligible for FMLA leave.",
            "status": "partial",
            "rationale": "While C0009 quotes paragraph (c)(3) in full, its summary generalized the clear demonstration requirement to any employee and omitted the specific statutory application to full-time teachers of elementary or secondary school systems or higher education institutions."
